This repository is an original, language-agnostic speaking-coach skill. Its
session design — patient conversation, selective correction, vocabulary
capture, a structured wrap-up, and sentence-by-sentence shadowing — is
adapted from:

  English Speaking Coach
  https://github.com/lolopodcast/english-speaking-coach-plugin
  Copyright (c) 2026 Prof. Shihmin Lo
  Licensed under the MIT License

The wording, the variant system, and the explanation-language behavior are
new. The original copyright notice and permission notice are included in full
below and must travel with copies and substantial portions of this software.

